bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怕爱","author":"刘克庄","text":"月中玉女虽严冷，雪里瑶姬转丽华。\n不管达官怕木稼，且留处士爱梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30103,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放言五首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"有酒聊排闷，无书可订顽。\n君看鸾铩羽，不若早知还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30104,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放言五首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"万里先行脚，三家晚闭关。\n曾求诗入海，亦作史藏山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30105,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放言五首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"镜悲鸾独舞，射感雉双飞。\n早认色空是，晚知婚宦非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30106,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放言五首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"恋阙子牟远，还乡贺监狂。\n老人忘节序，有菊即重阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30107,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放言五首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"丹剂乾铅汞，红尘扫秕糠。\n只消一只鹤，安用万头羊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30108,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昌黎子","author":"刘克庄","text":"渥洼驹孰非龙种，丹穴雏皆是凤毛。\n却怪韩公产韩昶，不如枚叔